$DATUM Diethyl
2,6-Dimethyl-4-[3-methyl-5-(2-oxo-2-phenylethyl)isoxazol-4-yl]-1,4-dihydropyridine-3,5-dicarboxylate
(14). Prepared from IDHP alcohol 13 to produce compound 14 as a pale
yellow solid (970 mg, 97%). 1H NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3): δ = 1.13 (t, J = 7.1
Hz, 6 H), 2.12 (s, 6 H), 2.27 (s, 3 H), 4.03 (m, 4 H), 4.30 (s, 2 H),
4.86 (s, 1 H), 5.51 (s, 1 H), 7.37-7.90 (m, 5 H). 13C NMR (500 MHz,
CDCl3): δ = 193.7, 167.6, 163.2, 160.3, 144.0, 136.6, 133.8, 129.1,
128.7, 122.7, 101.9, 60.4, 37.1, 29.6, 19.8, 14.8, 10.6. Anal. Calcd for
C25H28N2O6: C, 66.36; H, 6.24; N, 6.19. Found: C, 65.98; H, 6.43; N,
6.19.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM chemoselective (dihydropyridine is not oxidized)
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
