$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 10-methoxy-5,6,11,12-tetradehydro-7,8,9,10-tetrahydrohydrobenzo[10]annulen-8-one
(6). Dess-Martin periodinane (650 mg, 1.5 mmol) was added to a solution
of 20b (230 mg, 1.01 mmol) in dichloromethane (75 mL). The reaction
mixture was stirred for 2 h, diluted with ether/hexanes (1:1, 100 mL),
and filtered trough a thick layer of Celite-545. Solvents were removed
under reduced pressure to give 225 mg (97 %) of 6 as yellow oil. 1H NMR
(CDCl3, 400 MHz): 2.88 (dd J1=12.8 Hz, J2=3.2 Hz, 1H), 3.38 (d, J=15.6
Hz, 1H), 3.48-3.52 (m, 4H), 3.61 (d, J=15.6 Hz, 1H), 4.6 (dd J1=10.8 Hz,
J2=3.2 Hz, 1H), 7.26-7.3 (m, 2H), 7.34-7.39 (m, 2H); 13C NMR (CDCl3, 100
MHz): 38.1, 49.6, 57.0, 69.8, 87.4, 87.9, 88.2, 95.3, 127.5, 127.9,
128.2, 128.5, 128.7, 129.0, 198.1; HRMS calc. for C15H12O2 m/z: 224.0837,
found: 224.0829.
