Jasmin; Ducho, Christian; Sorensen, John L.; Claridge, Timothy D. W.;
Schofield, Christopher J.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of the American Chemical Society (2012), 134(1), 471-479

