$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 7a: To a solution of 5a (39.9 mg, 0.1 mmol) in dry CH2Cl2 (3 mL),
Dess-Martin periodinane (63.6 mg, 1.5 mmol) was added at room temperature
under N2 and stirred for 1 hours. After the reaction was completed
(monitored by TLC), the reaction mixture was diluted with ether and
poured slowly into a Na2S2O3:NaHCO3 (1:1) solution and stirred for 5
minutes. Ether was used in the extraction and the combined organic
extracts were washed with sat. NaHCO3, brine and dried over anhydrous
Na2SO4. Solvent was removed by concentration in vacuo. The residue was
purified by flash chromatography on silica gel, eluting with hexaneethyl
acetate (10:1) to afford the desired product ketone 7a as a white solid
38 mg (95%). Mp. 128.6-129.6; Rf 0.35 (hexane-ethyl acetate 4:1); 1H NMR
(300 MHz, CDCl3): δ 0.72 (3H, s, -CH3), 0.99 (3H, d, J=7.0 Hz, -CH3),
1.07 (3H, d, J=7.0 Hz, -CH3), 1.17 (3H, s, CH3), 0.97-2.49 (23H, m,
Steroid-H), 2.73 (1H, m, -CH-CH=CH2), 4.93 (1H, d, J=10.5 Hz, -C=CH2),
5.00 (1H, d, J=17.1 Hz, -C=CH2), 5.72 (1H, s, -C=CH-CO-), 5.75 (1H, m,
-CH=CH2); 13C NMR (75.5 MHz, CDCl3): δ 12.2, 16.2, 17.4, 19.6, 21.0,
24.4, 27.5, 32.0, 32.3, 32.8, 34.0, 35.6, 35.7, 38.6, 39.5, 42.6, 48.4,
49.7, 52.0, 53.7, 55.2, 112.9, 123.9, 143.2, 171.2, 199.5, 213.0; IR
(neat, cm-1): 3087, 2934, 1713, 1670, 1612, 1445, 1405; HRMS (EI) m/z
(M+): obsd 396.3029, calcd 396.3028 for C27H40O2.
