$DATUM green chemistry-solvent, green chemistry-waste reduction, ionic liquid
used, no carboxylic acid observed, using Dess-Martin reagent led to
faster reaction but lower yield, using hydrophobic ionic liquid (PF6
counter ion) gave the same result but led to problems with reagent
recovery, using organic solvents required higher temperatures and longer
reaction times
