$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: 15 % Dess-Martin periodinane (DMP) in CH2Cl2
solution (1.2 eq) was added to the α-sulfinyl allylic alcohol (1.0 eq)
and NaHCO3 (4.0 eq) in CH2Cl2 solution and the mixture was stirred for 30
min at room temperature. The mixture was quenched with saturated aqueous
NaHCO3 solution. The whole was extracted with CH2Cl2 washed with brine.
The organic layer was dried over Na2SO4 and the solvent was removed under
reduced pressure. The residue was purified with flush column
chromatography. (Ss,
E)-5-Methyl-1-phenyl-2-(4-tolylsulfinyl)hex-2-en-1-one (1i), (773 mg,
2.37 mmol) in 93 % yield as colorless oil. [α]D: +160.4° (c =0.70,
CHCl3). 1H-NMR (600 MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.58-7.57 (m, 2H), 7.53-7.51 (m, 1H),
7.39 (d, 2H, J= 8.25 Hz), 7.37-7.35 (m, 2H), 7.16 (d, 2H, J= 7.90 Hz),
6.82 (dd, 1H, J= 8.75, 7.22 Hz), 2.30 (s, 3H), 2.05-1.93 (m, 2H),
1.81-1.76 (m, 1H), 0.86 (d, 3H, J= 6.53 Hz), 0.85 (d, 3H, J= 6.53 Hz);
13C-NMR (150 MHz, CDCl3) δ : 192.7, 145.6, 142.0, 139.0, 138.1, 137.0,
133.7, 129.8, 129.2, 128.5, 125.1, 38.6, 28.5, 22.4, 22.1, 21.4; IR
(liquid film) cm-1 2957, 2871, 1654, 1594, 1451, 1358, 1230, 1056, 809,
761, 716; HRMS (FAB+) Calcd for C20H23O2S : 327.14186 [M+H]+ : found:
327.14187.
