$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM green chemistry-solvent, green chemistry-waste reduction, ionic liquid
used, no carboxylic acid observed, using hydrophobic ionic liquid (PF6
counter ion) gave the same result but led to problems with reagent
recovery, using iodoxybenzoic acid/reagent led to decrease in yield and
reaction rate, using organic solvents required higher temperatures and
longer reaction times
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
