$DATUM Preparation of 16. Dess-Martin periodinane (79.6 mg, 0.19 mmol) was added
to a solution of 13 (61.2 mg, 0.19 mmol) in CH2Cl2 (2 mL), and the
mixture was stirred at rt for 12 h. The reaction mixture was washed
successively with water (50 mL x 3) and brine (50 mL x 2), dried over
anhydrous Na2SO4, and filtered, and the solvent was evaporated in vacuo.
The residue was purified by PTLC using heptane-EtOAc (1:1) to give 16,
yield 54.7 mg, 88%.
