$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Synthesis of COOH-ONE (6). Dess-Martin periodinane (0.15 g, 0.35 mmol)
was added to a solution of 5 (0.067 g, 0.29 mmol) in CH2Cl2 (2 mL). After
1 h, the reaction mixture was concentrated and purified by column
chromatography (50% EtOAc/hexanes). The product was isolated as a white
powder (0.052 g, 79%). 1H NMR (CDCl3) δ 9.76 (d, 1H, J = 6.9 Hz), 6.86
(d, 1H, J = 16.2 Hz), 6.75 (dd, 1H, J = 6.6, 16.2 Hz), 2.67 (t, 2H, J =
7.2 Hz), 2.33 (t, 2H, J = 7.4 Hz), 1.66-1.59 (m, 4H), 1.35-1.28 (m, 6H);
13C NMR (CDCl3) δ 200.0, 193.4, 178.7, 144.9, 137.4, 41.1, 33.7, 29.0,
28.83, 28.78, 24.6, 23.5; HRMS (ESI) calculated 249.1097 (M + Na),
observed 249.1085.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM Dess-Martin oxidation
